  sequenceId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded
  notes: 'Plays after the assignment is loaded and unlocks the elevator. Source:
    HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md, stable marker Lobby_AssignmentLoaded.
    Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, companion-request volume is high across Building A's public
      level. The children's area, work pods, and park-side assistance points are
      all connected to the synchronized network.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: I can see that.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: This community averages one public companion unit for every four residents,
      above the residential norm.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That reduces gaps in care and helps residents handle emotional support,
      daily companionship, and childhood learning more quickly.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
